oGameDev VR Screen 1.png", "id": "1188261503383696", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823783_1188261510050362_5472519875604115720_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S8IVNnnWrSAQ7kNvwGPp4oW&_nc_oc=AdpA7gyWYHxs1MBh7lL5nRnVvQAruml0xnSZqcy420O20FA-0w1LiyKVQ_SfTdMPXAY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-Dvl6UdIMhwyRRPO5fg9AgllbT1HxLC4FcPZvgWNqQTA&oe=6A426749"}, {"file_name": "RetroGameDev VR Screen 2.png", "id": "1014015661078096", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823366_1014015664411429_2624389349405056523_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TuGD4W4rEokQ7kNvwE16h6P&_nc_oc=AdqIBSXNLuATmnLYQ2Wxc2OiSrvvhqrWIzuzN1yfdaZ8fr2_tBbWaDSMXf-pfvalPRM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8o7gDC3sRu2chO5MHEhvR3YF6jSJno9hRibK_mzj55kw&oe=6A426D39"}, {"file_name": "RetroGameDev VR Screen 3.png", "id": "1389679592970341", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823802_1389679596303674_7247600721434857762_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9HbpqtBAYY4Q7kNvwEf1Gey&_nc_oc=Adrobjx2Qh6pSqDSgzsTnyGVg4BBNTee_cWA2KmiXNsWEm1SsVdWJTXJMUcWf32mQ5s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-708c2oCwv0A8d71cn2gGl_9P-vJVMOuTFnEpYU0dxqQ&oe=6A429166"}, {"file_name": "RetroGameDev VR Screen 4.png", "id": "1363242579026429", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824741_1363242585693095_468145793917944651_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=znscPJvHkhUQ7kNvwFvQ5TV&_nc_oc=AdotYPXdRmBD4mxBiTRHx1T_yx4nU39Yp5A04ojnB5Z1ubDN-N5haSLvTWlleeLIRf4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9YcpRliUYs5ljEahCslE-zefiVLaP1WXAs7SsW0lJo0g&oe=6A4262D9"}, {"file_name": "RetroGameDev VR Screen 5.png", "id": "1517765113051101", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507883442_1517765116384434_4320304361351719612_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AksUqc_UXAwQ7kNvwF1t7BK&_nc_oc=AdqpOdLZlEY2UKAgnTkf8a0M8EY58GLAjRL5MwvUsJluW_yENeXRQ1-69JAHUgPa9rE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af87TGMfn2fOrZlMYq2XNn3cH_HvQVgia20T-AZYT1K7jg&oe=6A428FC1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x1440.png", "id": "2225811551578664", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499311597_2225811554911997_2083852182644206799_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=B3-V_wMaA6sQ7kNvwGdW98f&_nc_oc=AdqfgHZcOemVEAAYxJvmMJoUD7m50FG91D41bYktO9UenCP6AQXQLTw_PA-WbKMrqkk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-44JVA-Ynw6wfYQwfdueXuV_2_4BvRzVppa8pJmaowqg&oe=6A428EC1"}, "display_name": "RetroGameDev VR", "keywords": ["retrogamedev", "retro", "homebrew", "gamedev", "retrogaming"], "long_description": "Pull up a chair in your own 80s/90s bedroom. The CRT glows and the tools are waiting. RetroGameDev VR is a standalone Meta Quest app \u2014 part time machine, part hands-on workshop: learn how retro hardware really works, create your own games, play them across the room, and export them to run on real retro machines.\n\n**Learn**\n\nBuilt-in lessons open up the graphics, sound, and inner workings of real retro hardware.\n\n**Create and Remix**\n\nStart from a template game and make it your own. Use the built-in editors to redraw sprites, repaint palettes, design backgrounds, and compose sounds and music.\n\n**Play Your Creations**\n\nPlay the games you make on any of the bedroom's three displays \u2014 the desk monitor up close, the big-screen TV across the room, or the handheld you pick up and hold.\n\n**Mixed Reality**\n\nFlip into Mixed Reality anytime. The bedroom drops to passthrough, leaving the screen floating in space \u2014 resize it, move it, and play in your real room.\n\n**Export to Real Hardware**\n\nThis is where it leaves the app behind. Turn your creation into a working cartridge that boots on genuine retro machines \u2014 real hardware, not emulation.\n\n**Also Included**\n\nWatch your own video files on the bedroom screens in glorious retro style.\n\n**Emulator Cores**\n\nFree cores for multiple game systems can be downloaded in-app (online needed once for setup). No cores or games are bundled. You create your own or load your own game files, and you are responsible for having the right to use any files you load.", "short_description": "Step into an 80s/90s bedroom and discover how classic game machines really work. Learn the hardware from the inside, create and remix your own retro games with built-in editors, and play your creations right there in the room \u2014 or flip to Mixed Reality and play them in your own space. Then export your game as a real ROM that runs on genuine retro hardware. Part time machine, part hands-on game-making workshop \u2014 a standalone Meta Quest app, no PC needed."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://retrogamedev.github.io/retrogamedevvr-privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "RetroGameDev", "support_website_url": "https://www.retrogamedev.com/", "website_url": "https://www.retrogamedev.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD", "OCULUS_TOUCH", "TRACKED_KEYBOARD"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "27579869648367138"}, "review_messages": []}]}